      "description": "Product features:\nThe portable water bottle quick hook can be used to hang water bottles and wear them on belts, backpacks and other items. The mineral water clasp is made of double-layer thick webbing, and the durable plastic clasp is durable. It can be used with ordinary belt, tactical belt and tactical backpack. This is a powerful outdoor expansion device. The ring is used to hold the kettle, and the ribbon is used to hang on the backpack or belt. The inside diameter of the ring is about 1.19 inches (3cm); The ring has an opening that can be easily placed on the neck. It only needs to be pulled a little to keep stable and safe. Tactical equipment is real and easy to carry. Outdoor tactical hook elastic buckle design, plastic buckle, one button buckle, can be used immediately; Nylon material structure, comfortable to handle; Closed mode, snap fastener+hook hair cream, double layer stable, not easy to fall off. Outdoor tactical nylon webbing pot buckle, small and delicate, does not occupy storage space, and is convenient to use. It is the best equipment for outdoor sports enthusiasts.\nProduct packaging:\n1 water bottle buckle",
